      "ref": "BDB, גָּעַר",
      "preview": "גָּעַר: verbo: repreender.",
      "html": "<big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּעַר</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo. repreender (</strong>aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּעַר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܥܰܪ</span> <em>idem</em>, etíope ገዐረ <em>clamar</em>, sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">יגער</span> nome próprio, Sab. Denkm. <sup>p. 29.30</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.13\">Is 17.13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּעַרְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:6\" href=\"/Psalms.9.6\">Sl 9.6</a> + 2 vezes, etc.; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְעַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.2\">Zc 3.2</a> + 3 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְעֲרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:16\" href=\"/Ruth.2.16\">Rt 2.16</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּעַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:31\" href=\"/Psalms.68.31\">Sl 68.31</a>, infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">מִגְּעָר־</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.9\">Is 54.9</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹעֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:4\" href=\"/Nahum.1.4\">Na 1.4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּעֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:3\" href=\"/Malachi.2.3\">Ml 2.3</a>;—com <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> exceto <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:6\" href=\"/Psalms.9.6\">Sl 9.6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:31\" href=\"/Psalms.68.31\">Sl 68.31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:21\" href=\"/Psalms.119.21\">Sl 119.21</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:3\" href=\"/Malachi.2.3\">Ml 2.3</a> onde ocorre acusativo;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>repreender</em>, o pai a seu filho <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:10\" href=\"/Genesis.37.10\">Gn 37.10</a> (E), os ceifeiros a Rute <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:16\" href=\"/Ruth.2.16\">Rt 2.16</a>, o sacerdote a Jeremias <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.27\">Jr 29.27</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  de Deus repreendendo as nações <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:6\" href=\"/Psalms.9.6\">Sl 9.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.13\">Is 17.13</a>, os soberbos <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:21\" href=\"/Psalms.119.21\">Sl 119.21</a>, Satanás <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.2\">Zc 3.2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חית קנה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:31\" href=\"/Psalms.68.31\">Sl 68.31</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּאֹכֵל</span> (o enxame devorador de gafanhotos, refreando-os) <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:11\" href=\"/Malachi.3.11\">Ml 3.11</a>, o mar, secando-o <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:9\" href=\"/Psalms.106.9\">Sl 106.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:4\" href=\"/Nahum.1.4\">Na 1.4</a>, Sião <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.9\">Is 54.9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַזֶּרַע</span> a <em>semente</em> (impedir a colheita habitual) <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:3\" href=\"/Malachi.2.3\">Ml 2.3</a> (𝔊 Aq 𝔙 <span dir=\"rtl\">הַזְּרֹעַ</span>, <em>o braço</em>, a saber, dos sacerdotes, para que não o estendam a fim de abençoar).",
