      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּעָרָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino. repreensão</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.1\">Pv 13.1</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּעֲרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.5\">Ec 7.5</a> + 5 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּעֲרָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:16\" href=\"/Psalms.18.16\">Sl 18.16</a> + (sufixos 6 vezes);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  do homem <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.1\">Pv 13.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.8\">Pv 13.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.10\">Pv 17.10</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.5\">Ec 7.5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.17\">Is 30.17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  de Deus <a data-ref=\"Job 26:11\" href=\"/Job.26.11\">Jó 26.11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:16\" href=\"/Psalms.18.16\">Sl 18.16</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.16\">2Sm 22.16</a>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 76:7\" href=\"/Psalms.76.7\">Sl 76.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:17\" href=\"/Psalms.80.17\">Sl 80.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:7\" href=\"/Psalms.104.7\">Sl 104.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.2\">Is 50.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.20\">Is 51.20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.15\">Is 66.15</a>.",
