      "preview": "גָּרָה: verbo: suscitar contenda; envolver-se em contenda.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גָּרָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo.</strong> somente <strong>Piel: suscitar</strong> contenda, <strong>Hitpael: envolver-se em contenda (</strong>cf. hebraico novo Piel <em>suscitar, incitar</em>, contra <span dir=\"rtl\">(בְּ)</span> Hitpael; aramaico Pael <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּרֵא ܓܰܪܺܝ</span>; especialmente assírio <em>garû</em>, Qal <em>atacar, estar em guerra com</em>, <em>gârû, gîrû</em>, <em>inimigo</em>, etc. Asrb.<sup>Annals iv. 49, 50</sup> (KB<sup>ii. 190</sup>) também SASmith<sup>Asrb. i. ii. Gloss.</sup>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جَرَى</span> é <em>correr</em>, especialmente de água, <em>fluir</em>, etc.<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Piel.</strong>  Imperfeito 3.ª pessoa masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגָרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.18\">Pv 15.18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.25\">Pv 28.25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.22\">Pv 29.22</a>, todos com objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">מָדוֹן</span> <em>incitar, suscitar contenda</em>.—Sobre <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.8\">Dt 14.8</a> ver abaixo <a data-ref=\"BDB, גֵּרָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_גֵּרָה²\" dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרָה</a> sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, גֵּרָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_גֵּרָה²\" dir=\"rtl\">גרר</a>.<br><strong>Hitpael.</strong>  Perfeito 2.ª pessoa fem. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְגָּרִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.24\">Jr 50.24</a>; imperfeito 3.ª pessoa masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְגָּרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:25\" href=\"/Daniel.11.25\">Dn 11.25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיִתְגָּרֶ֯ו</span> v. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:10\" href=\"/Daniel.11.10\">Dn 11.10</a>; 2.ª pessoa masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְגָּרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.10\">2Rs 14.10</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.19\">2Cr 25.19</a>; jussivo apocopado <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְגָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.9\">Dt 2.9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.19\">Dt 2.19</a>; 3.ª pessoa masc. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְגָּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.4\">Pv 28.4</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:10\" href=\"/Daniel.11.10\">Dn 11.10</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:10\" href=\"/Daniel.11.10\">Dn 11.10</a> Ketiv, ver acima; 2.ª pessoa masc. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְגָּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.5\">Dt 2.5</a> (jussivo); imperativo masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְגָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.24\">Dt 2.24</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>incitar-se</em> contra (<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> pessoa), <em>envolver-se em contenda</em> com, literalmente <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.5\">Dt 2.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.19\">Dt 2.19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.24\">Jr 50.24</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.10\">2Rs 14.10</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.19\">2Cr 25.19</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרָעָה</span>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">רעה</span> personificado como adversário desafiado); também + acusativo de modo, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלְחָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.9\">Dt 2.9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.24\">Dt 2.24</a>; figuradamente <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשֹׁמְרֵי תוֹרָה יִתְגָּרוּ בָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.4\">Pv 28.4</a> <em>ao passo que os que guardam a lei contendem com eles</em>, isto é, com os que a abandonam. <strong>2.</strong>  absoluto, <em>incitar-se</em> (contra o inimigo), <em>fazer guerra</em>, somente <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11\" href=\"/Daniel.11\">Dn 11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְגָּרוּ וְאָֽסְפוּ הֲמוֹן חֲיָלִים רַבִּים</span> v. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:10\" href=\"/Daniel.11.10\">Dn 11.10</a> <em>eles farão guerra</em>, etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיָשֹׁב וְיִתְגָּרֶ֯ו עַד־מָעֻזֹּה</span> v. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:10\" href=\"/Daniel.11.10\">Dn 11.10</a> <em>e ele voltará e fará guerra, até à sua fortaleza;</em> v. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:25\" href=\"/Daniel.11.25\">Dn 11.25</a> seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמִּלְחָמָה</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחַיִל גָּדוֹל</span> (instrumental)",
