      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרִזִּים</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar.</strong> monte no norte de Israel, ao sul de Siquém (Nabulus), defronte de <em>Ebal</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עֵיבָל)</span>, que ficava ao norte; somente <span dir=\"rtl\">הַר ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.29\">Dt 11.29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.12\">Dt 27.12</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:33\" href=\"/Joshua.8.33\">Js 8.33</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:7\" href=\"/Judges.9.7\">Jz 9.7</a>; moderno <em>Jebel eṭ-Ṭôr</em> Rob<sup>BR ii. 274 ff.</sup> Bd<sup>Pal. 220, 222</sup>.",
