      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּ֫רֶם</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>osso, força, o próprio ser</strong> (?) <strong>(</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جِرْمٌ</span> <em>corpo</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרַם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܪܶܡ</span> <em>osso, o próprio ser</em><strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֑רֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:14\" href=\"/Genesis.49.14\">Gn 49.14</a> + 2 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּרֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.13\">2Rs 9.13</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרָמָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:18\" href=\"/Job.40.18\">Jó 40.18</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>osso</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.22\">Pv 17.22</a> (coletivo) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.15\">Pv 25.15</a>; do beemote (hipopótamo) <a data-ref=\"Job 40:18\" href=\"/Job.40.18\">Jó 40.18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עצם</span>, veja-se)<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>força</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:14\" href=\"/Genesis.49.14\">Gn 49.14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמֹר גָּ֑רֶם</span> <em>jumento forte</em> (literalmente <em>ossudo</em>, assim VB).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>o próprio ser</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עצם\" href=\"/BDB,_עצם\" dir=\"rtl\">עצם</a>), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.13\">2Rs 9.13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּרֶם הַמַּעֲלוֹת</span> assim Ges Ew Ke, mas o texto é duvidoso, ver conjecturas em Klo.",
