      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרָר</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar.</strong> ao sul de Gaza, geralmente identificado com o moderno <em>Umm Jerâr</em> Bd<sup>Pal. 159</sup> Guérin<sup>Judée ii. 257 ff.</sup>; mas <em>Wady Jerūr</em> a oeste de <em>ʿAin Ḳadīs</em> segundo Trumbull <sup>Kadesh Barnea 61 ff.</sup> cf. Guthe <sup>ZPV viii. 1885, 215</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:2\" href=\"/Genesis.20.2\">Gn 20.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:6\" href=\"/Genesis.26.6\">Gn 26.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:20\" href=\"/Genesis.26.20\">Gn 26.20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:26\" href=\"/Genesis.26.26\">Gn 26.26</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.12\">2Cr 14.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.13\">2Cr 14.13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרָ֫רָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:19\" href=\"/Genesis.10.19\">Gn 10.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:1\" href=\"/Genesis.26.1\">Gn 26.1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַ֫חַל גְּרָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:17\" href=\"/Genesis.26.17\">Gn 26.17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּגָר בִּגְרָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:1\" href=\"/Genesis.20.1\">Gn 20.1</a>.",
